# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore (applies because the build context is the
# umbrella root, which holds multi-GB venvs and the source PDF).
#
# **/.env is load-bearing, not hygiene: api/main.py calls
# load_dotenv(BACKEND_ROOT/.env, override=True), so a baked-in .env would
# override the container's injected DATABASE_URL with localhost — and bake the
# OpenAI key into the image.
**/.venv
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/.env
indexing-rag-context-pipeline/data
**/*.md
